# lib/timers.warp's rules that run code at compile time, its whole program or a rule word of extensions/rules/rule_words.warp:
# the compiler keeps them, taken with the module's own (rewrites.warp module_rule_paths; decision library-zero-bake-plan 1b)
// a program ending in a timer shows no value; the page shows main's last expression anew after each firing
// (extensions/rules/rule_words.warp listening_program)
rewrite $p => $q where program and $q = listening_program($p)
